WEBVTT

00:04.004 --> 00:10.004
<b>The new life I got from Kimizuka,
as a legendary detective, had begun.</b>

00:10.004 --> 00:16.184
<b>And not as an ordinary detective, but as
a detective who fights against androids.</b>

00:16.184 --> 00:20.854
<b>The first night after I resolved
to be reborn into a new me</b>

00:20.854 --> 00:25.444
<b>as a legendary detective, I had a dream.</b>

00:25.444 --> 00:28.734
<b>It was a dream about a person
who had formerly fought against</b>

00:28.734 --> 00:32.234
<b>the world's enemies
as a true legendary detective.</b>

00:33.864 --> 00:36.284
<b>I could consider the one in the dream,</b>

00:36.284 --> 00:41.204
<b>Siesta-<i>san</i>, to have the exact
opposite personality to me.</b>

00:41.204 --> 00:44.624
<b>She, the intellectual one,
and I, the intuitive one,</b>

00:44.624 --> 00:47.214
<b>had a big squabble in the dream.</b>

00:47.214 --> 00:51.844
<b>It was unbearable to see,
a quagmire of drama.</b>

00:51.844 --> 00:58.474
<b>In the end, though, I won; but no, I feel
as though Siesta showed more maturity</b>

00:58.474 --> 01:02.184
<b>and ceded the argument
to me of her own accord.</b>

01:09.654 --> 01:15.904
<b>But in the end, Siesta-<i>san </i>said she would
leave responsibility of Kimizuka to me.</b>

01:15.904 --> 01:19.824
<b>With that, both in name and in reality,
I can become a legendary detective.</b>

01:19.824 --> 01:22.454
<b>At last, I can become a somebody.</b>

01:22.454 --> 01:25.414
<b>Or, to put it in opposite terms,
failure is unacceptable.</b>

01:25.414 --> 01:28.214
<b>I hate the me that's a nobody.</b>

01:28.214 --> 01:31.464
<b>I don't ever want to
go back to that place,</b>

01:31.464 --> 01:34.634
<b>like a birdcage,
to the days of nothingness.</b>

01:34.634 --> 01:38.594
<b>That darkness was just...</b>

01:42.054 --> 01:45.934
Episode 10

01:42.054 --> 01:45.934
Episode 10

01:42.054 --> 01:45.934
So I Can't Become a Detective

01:42.054 --> 01:45.934
So I Can't Become a Detective

01:46.144 --> 01:51.774
<b>One week after Saikawa's live stadium
show, school's summer vacation had begun.</b>

01:51.774 --> 01:54.694
<b>It was the ideal chance to follow
through on promises I'd made</b>

01:54.694 --> 01:56.944
<b>to Natsunagi and Saikawa.</b>

01:56.944 --> 02:01.784
<b>I was thinking of just going to
a nearby seashore for starters, but...</b>

02:01.784 --> 02:06.544
<b>We're now on our way--
on course for the Aegean Sea!</b>

02:06.544 --> 02:09.624
<b>Hooray!</b>

02:11.294 --> 02:14.254
<b>The scale of this is too huge!</b>

02:17.304 --> 02:21.644
<b>Umm, Saikawa, we did say
let's go to the sea together,</b>

02:21.644 --> 02:24.604
<b>but how did that turn into an
eight-day shipboard journey?</b>

02:24.604 --> 02:29.524
<b>Well, come on. The ship has left port,
so let's shift into vacation mode!</b>

02:29.524 --> 02:35.524
<b>She's absolutely right.
Everybody hates a wishy-washy guy.</b>

02:35.524 --> 02:40.364
<b>Still, it's my first time on one of these,
too, so I'm looking forward to it.</b>

02:40.364 --> 02:42.074
<b>Thank you, Yui-<i>chan</i>.</b>

02:42.074 --> 02:46.834
<b>Don't mention it, Nagisa-<i>san</i>.
It's the very least I can do to repay you.</b>

02:46.834 --> 02:52.714
<b>Fight by our side against SPES. If you'll
do that for us, I have no complaints.</b>

02:52.714 --> 02:57.554
<b>Yes, of course. I'll do
anything I'm able to.</b>

02:57.554 --> 03:02.554
<b>Well, for nothing to happen
at all would be ideal.</b>

03:02.554 --> 03:04.054
<b>Kimizuka?</b>

03:04.054 --> 03:05.394
<b>Huh?</b>

03:07.564 --> 03:09.104
<b>Char?</b>

03:10.104 --> 03:11.564
<b>It's been, what, a year?</b>

03:11.564 --> 03:15.154
<b>Yeah. Since that day...</b>

03:16.404 --> 03:18.614
<b>Kimizuka, she's someone you know?</b>

03:18.614 --> 03:24.494
<b>Yeah, Char was my--
our associate back in the day.</b>

03:24.494 --> 03:27.244
<b>By this point, I didn't think
we'd ever meet again.</b>

03:27.244 --> 03:31.254
<b>Yeah, I was surprised, too.
Have you been doing well?</b>

03:31.254 --> 03:35.884
<b>By the look of it, it seems like
you're on this ship by chance.</b>

03:35.884 --> 03:38.804
<b>Is there something on this ship?</b>

03:38.804 --> 03:43.344
<b>Seriously... what on Earth have
you been doing all this time?</b>

03:43.344 --> 03:45.514
<b>All this time?</b>

03:45.514 --> 03:48.184
<b>Since Mom passed away.</b>

03:48.184 --> 03:53.894
<b>Kimizuka, did you have no intentions
of taking up Mom's work?</b>

03:55.194 --> 03:59.484
<b>If you mean her dying wishes,
I've taken on that task.</b>

03:59.484 --> 04:01.534
<b>And you are?</b>

04:01.534 --> 04:04.864
<b>I'm Nagisa Natsunagi. Legendary detective.</b>

04:04.864 --> 04:10.204
<b>Nagisa Natsunagi? Oh... You're...</b>

04:11.124 --> 04:14.214
<b>Could you go play cops-n-robbers
somewhere else?</b>

04:14.214 --> 04:18.134
<b>Don't parade your game of make-believe
that exploits Mom's life in front of me.</b>

04:18.134 --> 04:20.964
<b>I'm not playing any game!</b>

04:20.964 --> 04:25.554
<b>There absolutely has to be some purpose
to my being given life this way!</b>

04:25.554 --> 04:30.724
<b>A purpose that she entrusted to me!
So I'm taking up her dying wishes.</b>

04:30.724 --> 04:33.314
<b>I swear it by this heart!</b>

04:34.694 --> 04:38.064
<b>I see. Do as you like.</b>

04:42.404 --> 04:47.204
<b>But... I'm the one who's taking
on Mom's dying wishes.</b>

04:51.164 --> 04:53.834
<b>Umm... I'm sorry.</b>

04:53.834 --> 04:58.424
<b>On account of my inviting you two
on this ship, it's turned into all this...</b>

04:58.424 --> 05:02.714
<b>No, it's not your fault, Saikawa.
My apologies to you, too, Natsunagi,</b>

05:02.714 --> 05:05.844
<b>for entangling you in this weird--</b>

05:05.844 --> 05:07.554
<b>Natsunagi?</b>

05:11.724 --> 05:16.064
<b>That pisses me off!
There's nothing make-believe about it!</b>

05:16.064 --> 05:18.444
<b>She has no idea what I've been through...</b>

05:20.984 --> 05:24.654
<b>How about going for a dip in the pool
as a mood changer? Eh, Saikawa?</b>

05:24.654 --> 05:29.534
<b>Right! There's even a waterslide,
Nagisa-<i>san</i>! Let's go!</b>

05:29.534 --> 05:33.584
<b>--Off, off, off we go...
--H-Hold on, Yui-<i>chan</i>!</b>

05:33.584 --> 05:35.544
<b>So...</b>

05:42.464 --> 05:45.134
<b>How come?</b>

05:45.134 --> 05:49.304
<b>This makes 17 losses
in a row, only for me.</b>

05:49.304 --> 05:54.024
<b>Something's definitely off about this.
One more hand. One more hand!</b>

05:54.024 --> 05:56.394
<b>What are you doing, goofball?</b>

05:56.394 --> 05:58.144
<b>Who was--?</b>

05:58.144 --> 06:01.864
<b>Who's stupid enough to keep
gambling until they're in tears?</b>

06:04.904 --> 06:09.454
<b>So? You were looking for me
for a reason, right?</b>

06:09.454 --> 06:14.794
<b>Yeah. Weren't you saying earlier that
there might be something on this ship?</b>

06:16.914 --> 06:19.004
<b>Mom's bequest.</b>

06:19.004 --> 06:20.634
<b>Siesta's bequest?</b>

06:20.634 --> 06:26.134
<b>Yes, shortly before dying, Mom left behind
her dying wishes--her bequest--</b>

06:26.134 --> 06:28.724
<b>for the goal of defeating SPES
across the world.</b>

06:28.724 --> 06:33.014
<b>And one of them lies
untapped on this ship.</b>

06:33.014 --> 06:36.604
<b>It took time to delve into it,
but my information is accurate.</b>

06:36.604 --> 06:39.644
<b>A bequest from Siesta
is on this cruise ship...</b>

06:39.644 --> 06:42.734
<b>What's the connection to the casino?</b>

06:42.734 --> 06:46.114
<b>You know... something worthy
of being a bequest from Mom,</b>

06:46.114 --> 06:49.324
<b>I thought maybe if I kept
winning in the casino,</b>

06:49.324 --> 06:51.364
<b>they'd bring out some
jackpot prize kind of thing...</b>

06:49.784 --> 06:51.444
<b>Bequest</b>

06:54.534 --> 06:56.244
<b>You really are a proper idiot.</b>

06:56.244 --> 06:58.334
<b>What do you mean a "proper idiot"?</b>

06:58.334 --> 07:01.374
<b>Well, since you have no intention
of taking on Mom's dying wishes,</b>

07:01.374 --> 07:04.424
<b>at this point, it has nothing
to do with you anyway.</b>

07:04.424 --> 07:07.554
<b>I'm sorry I made you worry.</b>

07:11.014 --> 07:16.434
<b>So why didn't you try to become
a detective in Mom's place?</b>

07:16.434 --> 07:22.654
<b>It was what she, Siesta, said to me
on that day four years ago.</b>

07:22.654 --> 07:26.074
<b>You... Be my sidekick.</b>

07:27.444 --> 07:31.114
<b>So I can't become a detective.</b>

07:31.114 --> 07:34.324
<b>On into the future,
I will always continue to be her--</b>

07:34.324 --> 07:37.544
<b>the legendary detective's--sidekick.</b>

07:37.544 --> 07:41.004
<b>I'll live on, for her.</b>

07:41.004 --> 07:48.554
<b>You're a fool. The one who's truly
tied down by Mom is you, not me.</b>

07:48.554 --> 07:54.304
<b>Well, it's fine. I'll handle
things in my own way.</b>

07:54.304 --> 08:01.814
<b>So you find Mom's bequest--
your own answers--in your own way.</b>

08:17.284 --> 08:21.874
<b>Ha. I guess it's good they're
cutting loose while they can.</b>

08:43.644 --> 08:47.564
<b>After all that, I didn't
come across any leads.</b>

08:47.564 --> 08:49.864
<b>Something's weird here.</b>

08:49.864 --> 08:51.444
<b>What's weird?</b>

08:51.444 --> 08:55.324
<b>Sitting face to face with you
like this and eating.</b>

08:55.324 --> 09:00.124
<b>What else can we do? Saikawa said she's
making the rounds as a guest of honor.</b>

09:00.124 --> 09:01.494
<b>Are you dissatisfied being with me?</b>

09:01.494 --> 09:04.294
<b>I didn't say that.</b>

09:05.924 --> 09:09.594
<b>Kimizuka, what were you doing
when you didn't come to the pool?</b>

09:09.594 --> 09:10.924
<b>Well, I--</b>

09:10.924 --> 09:13.714
<b>After I went and bought a new swimsuit...</b>

09:13.714 --> 09:15.054
<b>What?</b>

09:15.054 --> 09:17.264
<b>Nothing.</b>

09:17.264 --> 09:20.014
<b>Natsunagi, do you have time after this?</b>

09:20.014 --> 09:22.224
<b>Huh? Well, um...</b>

09:22.224 --> 09:26.144
<b>If so, there's a little something
I want to discuss with you.</b>

09:26.144 --> 09:29.774
<b>Discuss? I mean, we could
discuss it here, now...</b>

09:29.774 --> 09:34.194
<b>Yeah... It's something that'd be
a bit awkward to discuss here.</b>

09:34.194 --> 09:36.534
<b>I'm remembering there was
a bar across from this place.</b>

09:36.534 --> 09:39.374
<b>Would you meet me there an hour from now?</b>

09:39.374 --> 09:44.374
<b>Umm, just me? You and I alone
together at a bar?</b>

09:44.374 --> 09:46.794
<b>Yeah, that'd be the situation.</b>

09:46.794 --> 09:49.634
<b>Yes, that would be fine...</b>

09:53.094 --> 09:54.344
<b>Huh?</b>

10:00.394 --> 10:01.974
<b>Did you wait long?</b>

10:09.484 --> 10:11.314
<b>You went to the trouble of changing?</b>

10:11.314 --> 10:18.824
<b>Eh? Oh, no, it's just, after showering,
this happened to be all I had to wear...</b>

10:18.824 --> 10:22.414
<b>So, what did you want to discuss?</b>

10:24.914 --> 10:30.794
<b>That was not the discussion
I expected. It's a different...</b>

10:30.794 --> 10:34.134
<b>Ultimately, it's the influence
of my heart's former owner...</b>

10:34.134 --> 10:36.514
<b>What are you muttering under your breath?</b>

10:36.514 --> 10:38.594
<b>Huh? What's that now?</b>

10:38.594 --> 10:40.894
<b>Eh? Why are you suddenly flipping out?</b>

10:40.894 --> 10:42.054
<b>I'm not flipping out.</b>

10:42.054 --> 10:43.144
<b>You <i>are </i>flipping out.</b>

10:43.144 --> 10:47.184
<b>I said I'm <i>not </i>flipping out!
Here's your payback!</b>

10:47.184 --> 10:48.684
<b>This is absurd!</b>

10:48.684 --> 10:53.364
<b>But still... she's not as bad a person
as I thought, that Char.</b>

10:53.364 --> 10:58.864
<b>Yeah, she's a pure and simple fool.
That's also her strong point.</b>

11:00.244 --> 11:06.204
<b>The truth is, I knew that I was
the one who was wrong.</b>

11:06.204 --> 11:09.794
<b>I merely received this heart,</b>

11:09.794 --> 11:14.214
<b>and got it into my head that I was
taking on her dying wishes.</b>

11:14.214 --> 11:19.174
<b>But, Natsunagi, why did you decide
you wanted to take up Siesta's mantle?</b>

11:20.594 --> 11:25.684
<b>Because... from a young age,
my body was a wreck.</b>

11:25.684 --> 11:28.564
<b>That sickroom was just like a birdcage,</b>

11:28.564 --> 11:31.564
<b>and I thought I'd never get out
of it for my entire life.</b>

11:31.564 --> 11:36.654
<b>I felt sure that stuck in there,
I could never be anything at all.</b>

11:36.654 --> 11:39.244
<b>That was really frightening.</b>

11:40.324 --> 11:46.874
<b>But I received a newfound life,
and I wound up flying free of that cage.</b>

11:46.874 --> 11:52.674
<b>And yet... I didn't know
how to, you know, fly.</b>

11:52.674 --> 11:54.384
<b>How to fly?</b>

11:54.384 --> 11:59.714
<b>Yeah, and so the way of living of the one
who relied on this heart previously</b>

11:59.714 --> 12:04.224
<b>would become my own way of living...
that's what I thought.</b>

12:05.144 --> 12:11.774
<b>So that was it. The only way Natsunagi
could live was by relying on Siesta.</b>

12:11.774 --> 12:15.774
<b>And that was the same for me as well.</b>

12:15.774 --> 12:20.654
<b>Excuse me... I'm going to go to bed.</b>

12:20.654 --> 12:22.114
<b>Okay.</b>

12:36.754 --> 12:41.094
<b>Repeat. This is an announcement
for all passengers.</b>

12:41.094 --> 12:44.684
<b>Hey, what's this announcement?
Where's that voice coming from?</b>

12:44.684 --> 12:48.434
<b>There wasn't anyone in the
radio room. What's going on?</b>

12:49.314 --> 12:50.724
<b>What's all this?</b>

12:50.724 --> 13:00.444
<b>A girl is being held in the lounge.
The girl's name is Nagisa Natsunagi.</b>

13:00.444 --> 13:01.984
<b>Kimizuka-<i>san</i>!</b>

13:03.444 --> 13:04.614
<b>Saikawa!</b>

13:04.614 --> 13:09.704
<b>It's Nagisa-<i>san</i>... I checked her room,
but she's nowhere to be seen.</b>

13:14.504 --> 13:19.504
<b>So is that bequest of Siesta-<i>san</i>'s
related to this incident?</b>

13:19.504 --> 13:23.014
<b>Yeah, we can't rule out that possibility.</b>

13:23.014 --> 13:24.724
<b>We've finished a sweep for explosives...</b>

13:24.724 --> 13:26.504
<b>All right, once more...</b>

13:25.554 --> 13:27.474
<b>Any sign of Natsunagi-<i>san</i>?</b>

13:27.474 --> 13:31.894
<b>Saikawa-<i>sama</i>... It's regrettable,
but we did not find her.</b>

13:31.894 --> 13:34.064
<b>However, we did find this...</b>

13:38.314 --> 13:40.484
<b>Kimizuka-<i>san</i>, this is...</b>

13:41.734 --> 13:44.904
<b>"At 8:00 p.m., bring the legendary
detective's bequest</b>

13:44.904 --> 13:47.414
<b>and come to the main deck."</b>

13:48.744 --> 13:50.834
<b>Would this be SPES?</b>

13:50.834 --> 13:53.744
<b>If it's the legendary detective's
bequest they're after,</b>

13:53.744 --> 13:56.964
<b>that's sufficient as
circumstantial evidence.</b>

13:56.964 --> 14:01.844
<b>But unfortunately,
we don't know what that is.</b>

14:01.844 --> 14:03.804
<b>If that's the case...</b>

14:07.094 --> 14:12.054
<b>All we can do is search for Natsunagi
herself, rather than for Siesta's bequest.</b>

14:32.124 --> 14:34.544
<b>Nothing here either, eh?</b>

14:34.544 --> 14:39.464
<b>I'm using my left eye; there shouldn't
be anything I'm overlooking.</b>

14:39.464 --> 14:42.004
<b>I guess... that's true.</b>

14:46.054 --> 14:48.844
<b>Squeeze the hands together.</b>

14:48.844 --> 14:53.604
<b>Roll out the shoulders, too.
Breathe in rhythm.</b>

14:53.604 --> 15:00.274
<b>Close the eyes once, breathe in deeply,
and let it out. The blood will flow.</b>

15:00.274 --> 15:05.484
<b>Open your eyes, and your field of vision,
which was clouded, will be clear.</b>

15:05.484 --> 15:07.444
<b>What is all that?</b>

15:07.444 --> 15:10.324
<b>It's a kind of an incantation
to calm my heart</b>

15:10.324 --> 15:14.284
<b>when it feels like it's about to burst
from stress before a live performance.</b>

15:17.544 --> 15:21.794
<b>I apologize for troubling you.
Pretty pathetic.</b>

15:21.794 --> 15:24.884
<b>Pathetic? You, Kimizuka-<i>san</i>?</b>

15:24.884 --> 15:29.174
<b>Yes, don't you think?
Shamefully losing my cool...</b>

15:29.174 --> 15:31.304
<b>That's a funny thing to say.</b>

15:31.304 --> 15:36.354
<b>I didn't expect that much of you
from the very start, Kimizuka-<i>san</i>!</b>

15:36.354 --> 15:40.854
<b>Wait, am I being dissed
in a huge way right now?</b>

15:40.854 --> 15:43.734
<b>No, it's not like that.</b>

15:46.324 --> 15:49.074
<b>I was the same way, too.</b>

15:49.074 --> 15:50.574
<b>The same way?</b>

15:50.574 --> 15:57.244
<b>Just like you, Kimizuka-<i>san</i>, I used to be
a person who couldn't live life alone.</b>

15:57.244 --> 16:02.004
<b>After my parents died, I lost sight
of any reference points for living.</b>

16:02.004 --> 16:04.754
<b>I got completely caught up
by promises from the past,</b>

16:04.754 --> 16:10.134
<b>and as a result, I attempted to commit
an act that could never be undone.</b>

16:10.134 --> 16:12.514
<b>Saikawa...</b>

16:12.514 --> 16:16.724
<b>But the ones who saved me, of all people,
were you, Kimizuka-<i>san</i>,</b>

16:16.724 --> 16:22.024
<b>who were seemingly in the same
circumstances as me, and also Nagisa-<i>san</i>.</b>

16:22.024 --> 16:27.114
<b>The two of you, trying to save me,
encouraged me to move forward.</b>

16:27.114 --> 16:32.114
<b>That's why I was able to take the hand
you offered without hesitating.</b>

16:32.114 --> 16:38.034
<b>That's why, I'm sorry to say, I won't
expect any more of you than is necessary.</b>

16:38.034 --> 16:41.044
<b>So in the same way,
please don't be concerned</b>

16:41.044 --> 16:43.834
<b>about me any more than necessary.</b>

16:43.834 --> 16:48.294
<b>That's the kind of partners we are.</b>

16:48.294 --> 16:52.134
<b>Yeah, that works. That's fine.</b>

16:52.134 --> 16:55.264
<b>If you call yourself the legendary
detective's sidekick,</b>

16:55.264 --> 16:58.684
<b>then maybe I should be
the sidekick to the sidekick.</b>

16:58.684 --> 17:01.184
<b>The legendary detective's
sidekick's sidekick?</b>

17:01.184 --> 17:02.604
<b>Yes, that's right!</b>

17:02.604 --> 17:06.154
<b>True, it's an arrangement somewhat
like Matryoshka nesting dolls.</b>

17:06.154 --> 17:09.274
<b>I don't know if I could
become your right hand,</b>

17:09.274 --> 17:12.494
<b>but I do think I could become
something like your left eye.</b>

17:12.494 --> 17:15.364
<b>Yeah, that would be ideal.</b>

17:20.034 --> 17:23.834
<b>After all that, we haven't
found anything yet.</b>

17:23.834 --> 17:25.374
<b>But, Kimizuka-<i>san</i>--</b>

17:25.374 --> 17:31.094
<b>Yeah, we were able to achieve the result
of not being able to find anything.</b>

17:31.094 --> 17:35.174
<b>If our adversary can't be found
even using your left eye...</b>

17:35.174 --> 17:37.224
<b>Has something occurred to you?</b>

17:37.224 --> 17:42.774
<b>Yeah. From here on, we don't need
deduction or tactics or anything.</b>

17:42.774 --> 17:45.854
<b>It's all-out war, you lowlifes.</b>

17:56.244 --> 17:59.994
<b>Enough with these roundabout dealings.</b>

17:59.994 --> 18:06.004
<b>Show yourself, Chameleon!
You're going to return Nagisa Natsunagi.</b>

18:06.004 --> 18:08.754
<b>Astute of you to know I was here.</b>

18:15.464 --> 18:16.304
<b>Natsunagi!</b>

18:16.304 --> 18:17.884
<b>Easy, now.</b>

18:19.934 --> 18:23.514
<b>I'd like you to hold still for me there.</b>

18:25.394 --> 18:27.524
<b>What is it you're after?</b>

18:27.524 --> 18:31.444
<b>I believe I've already
told you what I'm after.</b>

18:31.444 --> 18:34.784
<b>We'd be thrilled to hand over
that supposed "bequest,"</b>

18:34.784 --> 18:37.994
<b>but unfortunately, we don't
know a thing about it.</b>

18:37.994 --> 18:41.074
<b>Won't you just civilly
return Natsunagi to us?</b>

18:41.074 --> 18:43.784
<b>Well, this is a problem...</b>

18:44.914 --> 18:48.754
<b>That's not any sort of bargaining at all.</b>

18:49.874 --> 18:52.004
<b>Stop, Chameleon.</b>

18:59.094 --> 19:01.594
<b>Kimizuka...</b>

19:01.594 --> 19:03.104
<b>Natsunagi!</b>

19:07.434 --> 19:12.564
<b>I really seem to have
screwed things up. Sorry...</b>

19:16.324 --> 19:20.784
<b>All right. This girl's life,</b>

19:20.784 --> 19:26.164
<b>or the lives of the passengers they're
now desperately trying to evacuate.</b>

19:23.034 --> 19:26.164
<b>Everyone, come along! This way!</b>

19:27.414 --> 19:30.674
<b>I shall give you the honor
of choosing between these!</b>

19:30.674 --> 19:33.714
<b>What's the point of doing that?</b>

19:33.714 --> 19:36.554
<b>Well, it's frosting on the cake, of sorts.</b>

19:36.554 --> 19:38.094
<b>Frosting on the cake?</b>

19:38.094 --> 19:42.184
<b>Yes. If the legendary detective's
bequest can't be found,</b>

19:42.184 --> 19:45.894
<b>then this entire ship should be sunk.</b>

19:45.894 --> 19:51.604
<b>So why Natsunagi? What do you
creeps gain by taking her life?</b>

19:51.604 --> 19:54.404
<b>That's an extremely simple matter.</b>

19:54.404 --> 20:00.034
<b>It's because this girl is imbued with
the legendary detective's blood.</b>

20:00.034 --> 20:07.704
<b>Well, now. Make your choice: This girl's
life, or the passengers' lives.</b>

20:11.044 --> 20:12.834
<b>Kimizuka...</b>

20:16.844 --> 20:19.554
<b>Shoot me.</b>

20:19.554 --> 20:22.264
<b>What are you saying, Natsunagi?</b>

20:22.264 --> 20:28.854
<b>The response that's called for now is to
shoot me and save the passengers' lives.</b>

20:28.854 --> 20:33.104
<b>That kind of dispassionate way
of thinking is unlike you.</b>

20:33.104 --> 20:36.944
<b>Is it? Maybe so...</b>

20:36.944 --> 20:40.234
<b>But what's needed
in this situation right now</b>

20:40.234 --> 20:44.994
<b>is a legendary detective's reasoning,
not my strong emotions.</b>

20:44.994 --> 20:47.284
<b>You're a legendary detective, too!</b>

20:47.284 --> 20:51.664
<b>No, I'm not. I'm not anything at all.</b>

20:52.664 --> 21:01.884
<b>Kimizuka, when you said I didn't need
to replace anyone, I appreciated that.</b>

21:03.724 --> 21:05.474
<b>Thank you.</b>

21:14.024 --> 21:17.024
<b>Keep your "correct response."</b>

21:18.154 --> 21:21.444
<b>You say you're not anything at all?</b>

21:21.444 --> 21:23.494
<b>If you're not anything at all yet,</b>

21:23.494 --> 21:26.994
<b>you should be free to become
anything you want.</b>

21:26.994 --> 21:28.994
<b>If you don't know how to fly,</b>

21:28.994 --> 21:32.914
<b>you can learn from someone
how to flap your wings.</b>

21:32.914 --> 21:38.174
<b>If you don't know how to live life,
you can walk in line with someone else!</b>

21:41.634 --> 21:44.674
<b>Have you arrived at your answer now?</b>

21:44.674 --> 21:48.844
<b>Yeah. My answer was settled
from the very start.</b>

21:54.234 --> 22:00.314
<b>The arrangement is that Nagisa
Natsunagi can't die before I do.</b>

22:00.314 --> 22:04.074
<b>Sorry, but that's what was promised.</b>

